From: lichenggang <lichenggang@uniontech.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:18:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] po/zh_CN: shorten modem init string in help screen

The "send break" help line is 68 display columns wide (CJK characters
occupy two columns each), one column beyond the 67-column inner width
of the help window, so it wraps even after the multi-column window
drawing fix.  Shorten "初始化调制解调器" to "初始化 Modem" and re-pad
the dot runs so that the M and Q keys line up with the neighbouring
rows again.

---
 po/zh_CN.po | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/po/zh_CN.po b/po/zh_CN.po
index 38634ca..79baa0b 100644
--- a/po/zh_CN.po
+++ b/po/zh_CN.po
@@ -1185,7 +1185,7 @@
 
 #: src/help.c:64
 msgid " send break.........F  initialize Modem...M | Quit with no reset.Q\n"
-msgstr " 送出 break.........F  初始化调制解调器.....M | 离开而不重置.......Q\n"
+msgstr " 送出 break.........F  初始化 Modem........M | 离开而不重置.......Q\n"
 
 #: src/help.c:65
 msgid " Terminal settings..T  run Kermit.........K | Cursor key mode....I\n"
-- 
2.43.0

